Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.12,0:00:30.82,Narrator,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,717)\fs41}Mega Evolution:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.14,0:00:36.66,Narrator,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,717)\fs41}A new form of Pokémon evolution that has spread through the Kalos region.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.90,0:00:39.76,Narrator,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,717)\fs41}People, I ask you:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.59,0:00:44.84,Narrator,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,717)\fs41}Is Mega Evolution possibly a means to test Pokémon and people?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.89,0:00:50.80,Narrator,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,717)\fs41}Can Mega Evolution happen to all Pokémon?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.24,0:00:54.02,Narrator,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,717)\fs41}Apart from the fact that it unleashes Pokémon's hidden powers,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.89,0:01:00.57,Narrator,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,717)\fs41}changing their appearance to make them look much stronger and braver,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.73,0:01:03.92,Narrator,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,717)\fs41}we still don't know that much about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.87,0:01:23.13,MegaTitle,,0,0,0,,{\fs35\fad(1323,351)\pos(640,550)}The Strongest Mega Evolution
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.17,0:01:36.98,Commercialblue,,0,0,0,,{\fs39\fad(488,479)\c&H9242EA&\3c&HFFF9F2&\pos(640,590)\4c&H000000&\bord3\shad4}At the end of the show, we have an exquisite present quiz! Prepare to take notes!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.98,0:01:48.86,Warning,,0,0,0,,{\fad(524,514)\pos(640,40)}While watching anime, make sure not to sit too close to the screen and that the room is well lit.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.80,0:01:33.47,Ayaka,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,717)\fs41}A Mega Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.06,0:01:37.14,Alan,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,717)\fs41}Show me your strongest.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.86,0:01:40.77,Ayaka,,0,0,0,,You're quite confident, huh? I hope you're not just all bark and no bite.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.69,0:01:42.78,Ayaka,,0,0,0,,What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.69,0:01:44.15,Alan,,0,0,0,,Alan.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.68,0:01:45.78,Ayaka,,0,0,0,,I'm Ayaka.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.05,0:01:48.50,Ayaka,,0,0,0,,And this little one is my strongest partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.78,0:01:50.32,Ayaka,,0,0,0,,Come on out, Absol!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.13,0:01:56.16,Alan,,0,0,0,,It is present.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.81,0:01:59.67,Alan,,0,0,0,,Roar, Lizardon! Flamethrower!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.89,0:02:06.63,Ayaka,,0,0,0,,Absol, Psycho Cut!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.12,0:02:12.72,Ayaka,,0,0,0,,Megahorn!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.77,0:02:15.51,Alan,,0,0,0,,Grab its horn!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.98,0:02:30.91,ExtraType,,0,0,0,,{\fs37\fad(524,522)\pos(612,536)}Play a board game via the Pocket Monsters XY data broadcast!\NPress the d-button on your remote and try reaching the battles and the presents!!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.06,0:02:26.21,Alan,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,717)\fs41}Its power is impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.88,0:02:28.61,Alan,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,717)\fs41}But this can't be the end of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.73,0:02:31.11,Alan,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,717)\fs41}Let's get serious, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.72,0:02:33.73,Ayaka,,0,0,0,,Heh. I'll show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.10,0:02:45.50,Ayaka,,0,0,0,,Absol, mega evolve!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.33,0:02:59.29,Ayaka,,0,0,0,,What do you think of Mega Absol?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.01,0:03:03.21,Alan,,0,0,0,,I've never seen the Mega Evolution of Absol before.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.70,0:03:05.31,Ayaka,,0,0,0,,Show me you're serious as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.29,0:03:07.54,Alan,,0,0,0,,Respond to my heart,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.93,0:03:08.57,Alan,,0,0,0,,Key Stone!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.08,0:03:10.07,Alan,,0,0,0,,Surpass evolution!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.53,0:03:12.57,Alan,,0,0,0,,Mega evolve!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.86,0:03:47.23,Alan,,0,0,0,,My strongest: Mega Lizardon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.08,0:03:50.03,Ayaka,,0,0,0,,That black body looks quite cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.97,0:03:52.56,Alan,,0,0,0,,I'm honored to be praised by you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.10,0:03:54.85,Alan,,0,0,0,,Let's go! Steel Wing!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.42,0:04:01.78,Ayaka,,0,0,0,,Counter with Megahorn!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.30,0:04:13.98,Manon,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.08,0:04:20.65,Manon,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.09,0:04:22.64,Manon,,0,0,0,,Huh, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.37,0:04:46.48,Manon,,0,0,0,,What kind of Pokémon are {\i1}those?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.84,0:04:51.56,Manon,,0,0,0,,Is that an alternate colored Lizardon? But it seems different from an ordinary Lizardon...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.08,0:04:55.34,Manon,,0,0,0,,And that Absol has wings. I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.16,0:04:57.33,Alan,,0,0,0,,Dragon Claw!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.48,0:05:04.93,Ayaka,,0,0,0,,Dodge!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.85,0:05:13.73,Ayaka,,0,0,0,,I can't believe the power it has...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.22,0:05:15.61,Alan,,0,0,0,,Flamethrower!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.29,0:05:27.61,Manon,,0,0,0,,Amazing...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.46,0:05:29.62,Ayaka,,0,0,0,,Good job enduring that, Absol.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.96,0:05:30.75,Ayaka,,0,0,0,,Dark Pulse!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.84,0:05:38.59,Alan,,0,0,0,,Blast Burn!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.92,0:06:03.57,Ayaka,,0,0,0,,Absol!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.77,0:06:06.36,Ayaka,,0,0,0,,Absol...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.74,0:06:11.36,Alan,,0,0,0,,That was excellent, Lizardon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.38,0:06:15.42,Manon,,0,0,0,,Lizardon and Absol transformed?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.76,0:06:17.66,Ayaka,,0,0,0,,You fought well, Absol.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.80,0:06:21.06,Alan,,0,0,0,,Let's battle again someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.86,0:06:23.28,Ayaka,,0,0,0,,Are you always like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.02,0:06:25.80,Ayaka,,0,0,0,,Battling only for the sake of becoming the strongest?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.28,0:06:30.56,Alan,,0,0,0,,Together with this Lizardon, I want to defeat all Mega Evolutions...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.10,0:06:32.49,Alan,,0,0,0,,...and stand at the top!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.60,0:06:39.92,Alan,,0,0,0,,Mega Absol put up quite a bit of a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.62,0:06:41.90,Alan,,0,0,0,,It was well raised.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.88,0:06:50.09,Alan,,0,0,0,,Why don't you stop hiding and just come out?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.58,0:06:53.45,Manon,,0,0,0,,Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.84,0:06:55.32,Alan,,0,0,0,,Anything you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.64,0:06:58.80,Manon,,0,0,0,,Uhm, that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.38,0:07:03.73,Manon,,0,0,0,,I watched the battle earlier and was shocked when I saw that black Lizardon, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.29,0:07:07.18,Manon,,0,0,0,,What {\i1}was{\i0} that? Not a new Pokémon, was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.06,0:07:09.17,Alan,,0,0,0,,You want to battle us?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.34,0:07:13.08,Manon,,0,0,0,,Non, non! Impossible, impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.08,0:07:17.41,Manon,,0,0,0,,We only just set off a while ago, so there's no way we could battle like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.72,0:07:19.40,Alan,,0,0,0,,Seems like a beginner, Lizardon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.76,0:07:21.88,Manon,,0,0,0,,I'm Manon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.88,0:07:23.85,Manon,,0,0,0,,This little one is Hari-san the Harimaron.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.85,0:07:27.79,Manon,,0,0,0,,I got it at Professor Platane's place just recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.13,0:07:31.36,Manon,,0,0,0,,Oh, right! I'll tell you a nice story!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.76,0:07:35.61,Manon,,0,0,0,,There's an amazing Trainer that Professor Platane told me about!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.93,0:07:39.86,Manon,,0,0,0,,Some time ago, the Gablias at the laboratory went on a rampage, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.52,0:07:41.50,Alan,,0,0,0,,Gablias...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.05,0:07:44.90,Manon,,0,0,0,,You didn't know? It was a huge incident!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.26,0:07:50.22,Manon,,0,0,0,,And see, Satoshi, the Trainer who helped Gablias, he was really amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.48,0:07:57.28,Manon,,0,0,0,,When a Pokémon fell from the top of Miare's Prism Tower, he jumped right after it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.58,0:08:01.09,Manon,,0,0,0,,You can't do that unless you trust each other, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.34,0:08:04.64,Manon,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.13,0:08:05.52,Alan,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.64,0:08:07.86,Manon,,0,0,0,,Mister, what's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.73,0:08:09.24,Alan,,0,0,0,,Alan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.41,0:08:13.66,Alan,,0,0,0,,Right now, I'm traveling with this guy to master Mega Evolution.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.12,0:08:17.17,Manon,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, does Mega Evolution mean evolution?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.40,0:08:21.62,Manon,,0,0,0,,Do you possibly mean the black Lizardon from earlier, by any chance?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.24,0:08:22.96,Alan,,0,0,0,,Uh... Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.56,0:08:24.42,Alan,,0,0,0,,It was Mega Lizardon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.66,0:08:27.36,Manon,,0,0,0,,That's amazing! I didn't know there's an evolution like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.82,0:08:29.06,Manon,,0,0,0,,Hari-san, you were shocked too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.57,0:08:32.49,Manon,,0,0,0,,Hey, can Hari-san become like that, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.49,0:08:32.93,Alan,,0,0,0,,Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.73,0:08:36.94,Alan,,0,0,0,,It's not like I know everything about Mega Evolution.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.86,0:08:43.29,Platane,,0,0,0,,Two stones seem to have a strong connection to Mega Evolution.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.84,0:08:44.95,Alan,,0,0,0,,Two stones?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.48,0:08:48.28,Platane,,0,0,0,,One is held by the Trainer and the other by the Pokémon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.05,0:08:53.88,Platane,,0,0,0,,When the two stones resonate, the Pokémon temporarily attains great power.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.84,0:08:57.42,Alan,,0,0,0,,But where does that power come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.66,0:09:00.09,Alan,,0,0,0,,Is it given to them by humans?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.62,0:09:02.84,Platane,,0,0,0,,No, it's the Pokémon's own power.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.40,0:09:06.38,Platane,,0,0,0,,Humans only draw out the power using the stone, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.02,0:09:12.53,Platane,,0,0,0,,I think it is the strong bond between human and Pokémon which allows this phenomenon to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.90,0:09:13.96,Alan,,0,0,0,,A bond, huh...?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.33,0:09:19.52,Alan,,0,0,0,,Does Mega Evolution only come to existence through humans?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.62,0:09:20.94,Platane,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.34,0:09:24.20,Platane,,0,0,0,,That said, there are still many mysteries.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.40,0:09:29.09,Platane,,0,0,0,,It was an established theory that Pokémon can't turn back to their previous forms once they evolve.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.82,0:09:34.68,Platane,,0,0,0,,However, Mega Evolution overthrows that theory. They return back to normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.60,0:09:39.34,Platane,,0,0,0,,Another question is why it only occurs during battles.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.12,0:09:44.98,Platane,,0,0,0,,According to the information in our possession, there are cases of Pokémon changing their types and Abilities upon mega evolving.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.54,0:09:52.39,Alan,,0,0,0,,If their typing and Abilities change,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.93,0:09:57.10,Alan,,0,0,0,,releasing the power might place a burden on the Pokémon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.94,0:09:59.73,Alan,,0,0,0,,Is that why it only happens during a battle?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.50,0:10:01.86,Platane,,0,0,0,,That's a possibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.13,0:10:05.53,Platane,,0,0,0,,Either way, we don't have enough samples.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.45,0:10:07.18,Alan,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.41,0:10:10.03,Alan,,0,0,0,,I wonder how things are in other regions.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.92,0:10:14.16,Platane,,0,0,0,,So far, all reported cases happened here in the Kalos region.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.05,0:10:17.72,Alan,,0,0,0,,There, there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.66,0:10:23.42,Alan,,0,0,0,,The Pokémon might be trying to tell us something through Mega Evolution.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.80,0:10:26.80,Platane,,0,0,0,,That's exactly the topic of my research.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.44,0:10:31.85,Platane,,0,0,0,,As someone researching Pokémon in Kalos, it's something I don't think I can avoid looking into.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.24,0:10:35.86,Alan,,0,0,0,,I'll look for stones!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.73,0:10:37.81,Platane,,0,0,0,,Do you want to set off on a journey?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.41,0:10:39.56,Alan,,0,0,0,,It's okay, right, Professor?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.40,0:10:41.40,Platane,,0,0,0,,Uh... Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.30,0:10:44.52,Platane,,0,0,0,,But report to me on a regular basis.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.84,0:10:45.17,Alan,,0,0,0,,I will!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.84,0:10:53.32,Manon,,0,0,0,,What's wrong? You're so absent-minded.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.13,0:10:55.13,Alan,,0,0,0,,I was thinking back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.05,0:10:56.49,Manon,,0,0,0,,To what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.30,0:10:58.40,Alan,,0,0,0,,Professor Platane.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.73,0:10:59.00,Manon,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.90,0:11:01.82,Alan,,0,0,0,,I used to be the professor's assistant.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.24,0:11:05.50,Manon,,0,0,0,,Really? But why are you traveling if you're the professor's assistant?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.81,0:11:06.38,Alan,,0,0,0,,About that...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.38,0:11:08.04,Manon,,0,0,0,,Huh? Why? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.40,0:11:09.66,Alan,,0,0,0,,None of your business.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.28,0:11:14.89,Alan,,0,0,0,,It's me, Alan.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.08,0:11:17.40,Speaker voice,,0,0,0,,This is your next destination.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.94,0:11:23.56,Alan,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.98,0:11:24.50,Manon,,0,0,0,,Alan?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.62,0:11:26.50,Alan,,0,0,0,,Return, Lizardon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.96,0:11:33.99,Manon,,0,0,0,,Wait! I still have some questions...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.32,0:11:40.42,Manon,,0,0,0,,What now, Hari-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.94,0:11:43.68,Manon,,0,0,0,,I know, right? You want to know, too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.02,0:11:44.94,Manon,,0,0,0,,All right, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.88,0:11:53.54,Manon,,0,0,0,,Sorry for bothering you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.97,0:12:07.94,Commercialblue,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,630)}The Strongest Mega Evolution ~Act I~
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.97,0:12:02.98,Commercialblue,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,665)\fad(0,479)}Excellence! VS Mega Gablias!!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.06,0:12:07.94,Commercialblue,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,665)\fad(442,0)}Zumi of the Elite Four has a Mega Kamex!?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.70,0:12:02.10,Narrator,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,717)}This program is brought to you by these sponsors.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.55,0:12:24.52,Commercialblue,,0,0,0,,{\fs39\fad(490,479)\c&H9242EA&\3c&HFFF9F2&\pos(640,590)\4c&H000000&\bord3\shad4}The exquisite present quiz is soon! Prepare to take notes!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.24,0:12:19.44,Manon,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,717)\fs41}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.43,0:12:23.10,Manon,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,717)\fs41}Where has he gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.59,0:12:43.35,Alan,,0,0,0,,I found it...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.43,0:12:48.36,Alan,,0,0,0,,There's no mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.00,0:12:51.46,Manon,,0,0,0,,Maybe he's in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.31,0:12:56.26,Manon,,0,0,0,,Alan, found you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.03,0:12:57.88,Alan,,0,0,0,,You're still there?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.43,0:12:59.64,Manon,,0,0,0,,Were you looking for something?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.72,0:13:02.23,Manon,,0,0,0,,Something related to Mega Evolution?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.66,0:13:03.82,Alan,,0,0,0,,You're pesky.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.51,0:13:05.59,Louis,,0,0,0,,Wait a second!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.28,0:13:10.19,Louis,,0,0,0,,That's a Mega Stone, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.59,0:13:16.28,Louis,,0,0,0,,I was told to bring that as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.95,0:13:19.07,Alan,,0,0,0,,Hide over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.07,0:13:19.39,Manon,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.12,0:13:23.19,Louis,,0,0,0,,Why don't we battle over that Mega Stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.52,0:13:25.12,Alan,,0,0,0,,And if I say no?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.12,0:13:27.12,Louis,,0,0,0,,Don't be so cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.12,0:13:28.95,Louis,,0,0,0,,My partner, Gabunoji!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.47,0:13:34.24,Alan,,0,0,0,,A Gablias...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.84,0:13:37.60,Louis,,0,0,0,,A battle between two who can mega evolve.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.48,0:13:41.99,Louis,,0,0,0,,I've got a Key Stone, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.75,0:13:46.18,Louis,,0,0,0,,Oh, looks like you're getting motivated.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.61,0:13:47.87,Alan,,0,0,0,,Come out, Lizardon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.95,0:13:56.94,Alan,,0,0,0,,Let's mega evolve right away, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.32,0:13:58.84,Louis,,0,0,0,,That's the spirit!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.19,0:14:03.41,Louis,,0,0,0,,I'm the great Dragon Trainer Louis. My Gabunoji is quite impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.84,0:14:05.71,Alan,,0,0,0,,My partner is a Dragon too, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.06,0:14:10.41,Louis,,0,0,0,,Wha? What kind of amateur are you? Lizardon's not a Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.12,0:14:12.46,Alan,,0,0,0,,Who's the amateur here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.35,0:14:13.84,Alan,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.51,0:14:17.50,Alan,,0,0,0,,Time to battle, Lizardon! Release your power and mega evolve!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.00,0:14:29.38,Louis,,0,0,0,,We won't hold back either! Open your eyes and take a good look!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.38,0:14:32.27,Louis,,0,0,0,,Gabunoji, mega evolve!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.84,0:14:41.31,Manon,,0,0,0,,I can feel they're radiating with power...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.35,0:14:43.91,Louis,,0,0,0,,Dragon Rush!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.95,0:14:52.88,Louis,,0,0,0,,It hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.30,0:14:57.72,Louis,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.56,0:14:59.67,Alan,,0,0,0,,Flamethrower!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.14,0:15:09.02,Louis,,0,0,0,,All right! There's more!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.32,0:15:10.56,Louis,,0,0,0,,Dual Chop!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.64,0:15:16.81,Alan,,0,0,0,,Dragon Claw!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.74,0:15:48.32,Louis,,0,0,0,,Gabunoji...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.18,0:15:50.75,Alan,,0,0,0,,Well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.20,0:15:53.85,Alan,,0,0,0,,Remember this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.07,0:15:58.51,Alan,,0,0,0,,When this guy mega evolves, it becomes a Fire/Dragon type.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.43,0:16:02.48,Manon,,0,0,0,,Amazing... He won again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.24,0:16:15.37,Alan,,0,0,0,,Don't follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.71,0:16:17.08,Manon,,0,0,0,,I can do whatever I want!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.10,0:16:26.78,Manon,,0,0,0,,Alan, you may seem a little scary and all, but you're super-nice to Lizardon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.15,0:16:30.55,Manon,,0,0,0,,I think you {\i1}do{\i0} love Pokémon after all, you're definitely not a bad person,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.86,0:16:35.83,Manon,,0,0,0,,and you have a big dream like becoming the strongest Mega Evolution user, so you're kind of my ideal type!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.42,0:16:38.31,Alan,,0,0,0,,Do you want to praise me or diss me? Make up your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.00,0:16:41.03,Manon,,0,0,0,,Besides, I want to mega evolve.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.48,0:16:45.78,Manon,,0,0,0,,I want to get more and more Pokémon, raise them to become strong and then win against you and Lizardon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.30,0:16:47.52,Alan,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.75,0:16:49.02,Manon,,0,0,0,,What's with that tone?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.19,0:16:57.51,Manon,,0,0,0,,It's a Flabebe! Hari-san, let's get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.64,0:17:00.62,Manon,,0,0,0,,There it is! Pin Missile!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.00,0:17:13.92,Manon,,0,0,0,,Vine Whip!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.10,0:17:20.24,Manon,,0,0,0,,Geez, how nimble you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.24,0:17:21.99,Manon,,0,0,0,,Why isn't it landing hits?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.99,0:17:22.76,Alan,,0,0,0,,You're struggling.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.47,0:17:26.67,Alan,,0,0,0,,Don't you have moves that could poison or confuse it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.44,0:17:28.30,Manon,,0,0,0,,I do...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.56,0:17:30.57,Alan,,0,0,0,,Use them. They'll slow its movement.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.94,0:17:32.78,Manon,,0,0,0,,Got it. Hari-san, Toxic!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.80,0:17:41.79,Manon,,0,0,0,,Amazing, it's working!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.79,0:17:43.60,Alan,,0,0,0,,Don't get distracted. Throw a ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.60,0:17:44.18,Manon,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.10,0:17:47.34,Manon,,0,0,0,,Please, monster ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.51,0:17:59.07,Manon,,0,0,0,,All right! I got my first wild Pokémon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.07,0:18:01.02,Alan,,0,0,0,,That's great. Hurry up and treat that poisoning.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.48,0:18:03.36,Manon,,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.96,0:18:09.91,Joy,,0,0,0,,Here, Flabebe has fully recovered.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.91,0:18:11.92,Manon,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Joy-san, Pukurin!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.15,0:18:14.99,Manon,,0,0,0,,Fla-chan, please bear with me from now on!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.80,0:18:20.58,Manon,,0,0,0,,Oh, right. Do you know where the Trainer I was with is now?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.07,0:18:22.35,Joy,,0,0,0,,He already left.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.35,0:18:22.98,Manon,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.98,0:18:26.34,Joy,,0,0,0,,When I told him that Zumi-san of the Elite Four has a restaurant nearby...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.76,0:18:28.80,Manon,,0,0,0,,Zumi-sama of the Elite Four, you say?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.04,0:18:37.19,Manon,,0,0,0,,Hurry, Hari-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.91,0:18:49.04,Zumi,,0,0,0,,Welcome. My name is Zumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.43,0:18:51.07,Alan,,0,0,0,,I want to try your unofficial menu.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.27,0:18:59.55,Zumi,,0,0,0,,Understood. However, it is anything but gentle on the taste buds.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.55,0:19:01.08,Alan,,0,0,0,,I actually prefer that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.43,0:19:03.63,Manon,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey! Don't leave me behind!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.12,0:19:05.96,Zumi,,0,0,0,,Who is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.38,0:19:07.67,Manon,,0,0,0,,I'm his travel companion!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.32,0:19:09.34,Manon,,0,0,0,,Whoa, it's you in the flesh!?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.42,0:19:12.80,Zumi,,0,0,0,,Now then, young lady, you can come with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.82,0:19:23.92,Manon,,0,0,0,,I wonder if Zumi-san's Pokémon mega evolves, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.23,0:19:29.39,Zumi,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, but you're using a Fire type against me, a Water type Trainer?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.80,0:19:34.39,Alan,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know. But I want to be the strongest together with Lizardon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.99,0:19:39.87,Alan,,0,0,0,,Regardless of type and compatibility, the bond between us will overcome reason!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.91,0:19:42.31,Alan,,0,0,0,,Respond to my heart,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.54,0:19:43.48,Alan,,0,0,0,,Key Stone!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.69,0:19:45.83,Alan,,0,0,0,,Surpass evolution!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.38,0:19:47.47,Alan,,0,0,0,,Mega evolve!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.27,0:19:57.74,Zumi,,0,0,0,,It is promising to see it devote its body and soul to the Pokémon battle...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.00,0:19:59.55,Zumi,,0,0,0,,It's truly an art.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.80,0:20:01.64,Zumi,,0,0,0,,I'd like to see you surpass me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.99,0:20:04.48,Alan,,0,0,0,,Show me the full power of an Elite Four member.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.99,0:20:05.73,Alan,,0,0,0,,Dragon Claw!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.27,0:20:10.88,Zumi,,0,0,0,,Let's start with the hors d'oeuvre.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.30,0:20:12.74,Zumi,,0,0,0,,Rapid-fire Hydro Pump!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.90,0:20:19.16,Zumi,,0,0,0,,Skull Bash!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.71,0:20:30.17,Manon,,0,0,0,,Whoa, they both have amazing power!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.83,0:20:34.38,Zumi,,0,0,0,,Its speed and power are exquisite. What an excellent texture.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.92,0:20:36.84,Alan,,0,0,0,,It's time for the main dish to get served.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.31,0:20:38.26,Zumi,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.12,0:20:40.51,Zumi,,0,0,0,,Let me offer you a taste...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.85,0:20:42.60,Zumi,,0,0,0,,of my artistic main dish!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.76,0:20:46.02,Zumi,,0,0,0,,Kamex, mega evolve!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.92,0:20:53.57,Manon,,0,0,0,,As I thought, it mega evolved!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.88,0:20:55.07,Alan,,0,0,0,,Steel Wing!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.58,0:20:59.48,Zumi,,0,0,0,,Dragon Pulse!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.20,0:21:12.32,Zumi,,0,0,0,,Mega Kamex's Ability is Mega Launcher.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.06,0:21:16.34,Zumi,,0,0,0,,The power of Pulse moves increases compared to when it was a Kamex.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.71,0:21:18.66,Zumi,,0,0,0,,Could you taste it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.11,0:21:22.36,Zumi,,0,0,0,,Moreover, we shall let you experience the water power of a Mega Evolution.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.18,0:21:24.14,Zumi,,0,0,0,,Hydro Pump!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.98,0:21:30.55,Alan,,0,0,0,,Charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.39,0:21:36.15,Zumi,,0,0,0,,Power-Up Punch!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.47,0:21:37.40,Alan,,0,0,0,,Flamethrower!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.04,0:21:48.91,Alan,,0,0,0,,It's not like Fire has no effect at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.92,0:21:55.30,Alan,,0,0,0,,Dragon Claw!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.95,0:22:03.96,Zumi,,0,0,0,,It's been a while since I last had fresh meat with a backbone.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.47,0:22:06.27,Zumi,,0,0,0,,But I shall finish it with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.27,0:22:07.70,Zumi,,0,0,0,,Dragon Pulse!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.78,0:22:23.53,Zumi,,0,0,0,,The match is over, it seems.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.60,0:22:26.16,Manon,,0,0,0,,Zumi-san is too strong...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.22,0:22:29.98,Alan,,0,0,0,,Lizardon, thanks for the hard work.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.20,0:22:34.08,Alan,,0,0,0,,We're no match for the Elite Four, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.67,0:22:39.34,Zumi,,0,0,0,,They were powerful enough to corner us even with us a type disadvantage...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.20,0:22:41.11,Zumi,,0,0,0,,That was excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.35,0:22:53.85,Manon,,0,0,0,,Wait, Alan!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.02,0:23:04.66,Commercialblue,,0,0,0,,{\fs39\fad(487,479)\c&H9242EA&\3c&HFFF9F2&\pos(640,590)\4c&H000000&\bord3\shad4}The exquisite present quiz will be right after this! Prepare to take notes!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.30,0:22:59.07,Alan,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,717)\fs41}Give it a rest already.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.57,0:23:02.42,Manon,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,717)\fs41}Non, non! I will definitely mega evolve, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.71,0:23:04.86,Alan,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,717)\fs41}The one evolving won't be you, but your Pokémon.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.16,0:23:08.24,Manon,,0,0,0,,I know that! I'll search for those stones too.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.24,0:23:10.06,Manon,,0,0,0,,If I'm with you, I'll find some for sure, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.51,0:23:11.31,Alan,,0,0,0,,Do as you please.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.48,0:23:13.87,Manon,,0,0,0,,Uh, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.08,0:23:21.16,Narrator,,0,0,0,,The number of Pokémon able to mega evolve increase more and more.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.26,0:23:25.07,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Unknown Mega Evolutions, awaken!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.07,0:23:30.98,Narrator,,0,0,0,,And fill this world with powerful might!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.34,0:23:45.47,Platane,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,717)\fs41}How will this great power called Mega Evolution...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.86,0:23:49.95,Platane,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,717)\fs41}...influence humans and Pokémon?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.59,0:23:52.86,Platane,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,717)\fs41}We're living in changing times.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.06,0:23:57.39,Platane,,0,0,0,,Alan, let's solve the mystery of Mega Evolution!